  nonce: 67c1  # 67c1
  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-11-19: not 13:00 or 17:00 (they would clog CI for the owner); the other proposed times are fine. Schedule: full suite at 01:00, 09:00, 21:00 UTC ('0 1,9,21 * * *'), nightly unchanged (05:30). Longest wait for a break: 09:00 -> 21:00 = 12 h (as today's longest); overnight 21:00 -> 01:00 = 4 h, 01:00 -> 09:00 = 8 h. The owner changes the Woodpecker cron; the agent updates the docs and any code that assumes 01:00/13:00."  # 67c1
